@startuml B2B_Payout_Sequence
autonumber
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10

actor "Cron Scheduler / B2B Admin" as Scheduler
participant "Billing Service" as BillSvc
participant "Double-Entry Ledger" as Ledger
database "PostgreSQL Billing DB" as DB
participant "Banking Payout Gateway (Stripe Connect / Wise)" as BankPSP
actor "B2B Fleet / Driver Bank Account" as PartnerBank

== Step 1: Payout Batch Settlement Calculation ==
Scheduler -> BillSvc: TriggerWeeklyPayoutBatch(tenant_id, cutoff_timestamp)
BillSvc -> Ledger: CalculateSettledBalances(tenant_id, status='SETTLED')
Ledger -> DB: SELECT SUM(amount) FROM ledger_entries WHERE account_type='PARTNER_PAYABLE' AND settled=true
DB --> Ledger: Partner Balance: $14,250.00 (Gross: $17,000 - Platform Commission 15%: $2,550 - Fees: $200)
Ledger --> BillSvc: Settlement Summary Ready

== Step 2: Ledger Journal Reservation ==
BillSvc -> DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
BillSvc -> Ledger: CreateJournal(type="PAYOUT_RESERVATION", amount=$14,250.00)
note over DB
  Debit: Partner Payable Liability ($14,250)
  Credit: In-Transit Payout Clearing ($14,250)
end note
BillSvc -> DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION

== Step 3: Bank Payout Execution ==
BillSvc -> BankPSP: POST /v1/transfers {destination_iban, amount: 1425000, currency: "USD", idempotency_key}
BankPSP --> BillSvc: 202 Accepted (transfer_id: "tr_991823901")

== Step 4: Webhook Settlement Confirmation ==
BankPSP -> BillSvc: Webhook: transfer.paid {transfer_id: "tr_991823901", status: "SUCCEEDED"}
BillSvc -> DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
BillSvc -> Ledger: CreateJournal(type="PAYOUT_SETTLED")
note over DB
  Debit: In-Transit Payout Clearing ($14,250)
  Credit: Platform Bank Operating Asset ($14,250)
end note
BillSvc -> DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION

BankPSP -> PartnerBank: Direct ACH / SEPA Wire Transfer Received ($14,250.00)
BillSvc --> Scheduler: Payout Batch Completed Successfully (Receipt Generated)

@enduml
